DESCRIPTION:Join the BAMPFA Student Committee for CineSpin\, our exciting 
 annual film and live music event. This year we are thrilled that The Berke
 ley Nu Jazz Collective will accompany He Who Gets Slapped. Lon Chaney\, th
 e Man of a Thousand Faces\, stars as the titular “He” in He Who Gets S
 lapped . “As perfect as any screen character could be” (Mordaunt Hall
 \, New York Times )\, Chaney is a clown in a traveling circus looking to e
 xact spectacular revenge against the man who cheated him from a brilliant 
 career as a scientist. Credited as Victor Seastrom for this US production
 \, Swedish director Victor Sjöström’s remarkable stylistic facility is
  everywhere in evidence\, with the circus scenes bordering on the e\nCateg
 ory: Films\nOriginal listing: https://events.berkeley.edu/BAMPFA/event/331
