DESCRIPTION:A cornerstone of the department’s season\, student performer
 s join Gamelan Sari Raras and take the stage under the lead of longtime en
 semble director Midiyanto. This intricate ensemble art form—which famous
 ly inspired the impressionist harmonies of 19th-century Western composers
 —continues to bridge the divide of global music. For the Fall semester\,
  the ensemble will explore gamelan’s past and present through traditiona
 l compositions\, innovative new works by Midiyanto\, the transcendent voca
 l styling of Heni Savitri\, and the stately elegance of classical court da
 nce by Lestari Indonesia (directed by Ninik Lunde). Midiyanto\, director\n
 Category: Performing Arts\nOriginal listing: https://events.berkeley.edu/l
 ive/events/326572-javanese-gamelan
LOCATION:Hertz Concert Hall\, Hertz Concert Hall
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://events.berkeley.edu/live/events/326572-javanese-gamelan
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-REGION:us
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-SOURCE:berkeley-arts
END:VEVENT
